{"cue": 1, "end_ms": 5700, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 2960, "text": "We've got five minutes before Harry's\nsupposed to be sworn in."}
{"cue": 2, "end_ms": 6960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 5960, "text": "Where is Dan?"}
{"cue": 3, "end_ms": 10460, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 7600, "text": "Mac and Bull are trying to sweet -talk\nhim into covering for him."}
{"cue": 4, "end_ms": 11740, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 10740, "text": "Right this way."}
{"cue": 5, "end_ms": 16660, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 14020, "text": "Here, put this robe on, Dan. No, I\nwon't."}
{"cue": 6, "end_ms": 19080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 17160, "text": "Okay, Bull, make a wish."}
{"cue": 7, "end_ms": 26160, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 21460, "text": "Come on, you guys, don't you realize\nimpersonating a judge is a federal"}
{"cue": 8, "end_ms": 30060, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 26460, "text": "I will spend the next ten years in\nprison dancing with some guy named Bruno"}
{"cue": 9, "end_ms": 31060, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 30060, "text": "the shower room."}
{"cue": 10, "end_ms": 36010, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 32970, "text": "And Mr. Fenton from the mayor's\ncommittee already thinks you're hairy."}
{"cue": 11, "end_ms": 38510, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 36010, "text": "judge is coming to swear you in from\ndowntown. He doesn't know the"}
{"cue": 12, "end_ms": 39750, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 38630, "text": "But believe me, there's no problem."}
{"cue": 13, "end_ms": 41430, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 40430, "text": "You're right."}
{"cue": 14, "end_ms": 42490, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 41490, "text": "Because I'm leaving."}
{"cue": 15, "end_ms": 48610, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 44110, "text": "Is there anything I can do to make you\nreconsider?"}
{"cue": 16, "end_ms": 50629, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 49630, "text": "Hello again."}
{"cue": 17, "end_ms": 52510, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 50630, "text": "Oh, hello, Mr."}
{"cue": 18, "end_ms": 53950, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 52950, "text": "Fenton."}
{"cue": 19, "end_ms": 55510, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 54510, "text": "Hello."}
{"cue": 20, "end_ms": 57810, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 56150, "text": "Why are you strangling your judge?"}
{"cue": 21, "end_ms": 62830, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 58770, "text": "Strangling? Oh, no, no, no. I'm just\nmassaging the tension from his Adam's"}
{"cue": 22, "end_ms": 63830, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 62830, "text": "apple."}
{"cue": 23, "end_ms": 65550, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 64170, "text": "Feeling relaxed now, sir?"}
{"cue": 24, "end_ms": 67670, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 66050, "text": "See? Nice and loose."}
{"cue": 25, "end_ms": 71610, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 69690, "text": "Ready to be sworn in again, Judge Stone?"}
{"cue": 26, "end_ms": 77470, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 75570, "text": "He's very excited about it."}
{"cue": 27, "end_ms": 81730, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 77730, "text": "Oh, by the way, the judge we originally\nscheduled to do the ceremony got sick."}
{"cue": 28, "end_ms": 84030, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 81870, "text": "So you're going to be sworn in by Judge\nCrockett."}
{"cue": 29, "end_ms": 86150, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 84490, "text": "What? He knows us?"}
{"cue": 30, "end_ms": 87650, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 86650, "text": "He knows Harry?"}
{"cue": 31, "end_ms": 89750, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 88750, "text": "He knows me."}
{"cue": 32, "end_ms": 93550, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 92070, "text": "Yes, but he's coming anyway."}
{"cue": 33, "end_ms": 97850, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 95610, "text": "Great, that settles it. I am going to\nprison."}
{"cue": 34, "end_ms": 99690, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 98310, "text": "But look on the bright side, Dan."}
{"cue": 35, "end_ms": 102450, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 100090, "text": "You'll know lots of people because you\nconvicted most of them."}
{"cue": 36, "end_ms": 108490, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 103310, "text": "Oh, Dan, calm down. It'll be okay."}
{"cue": 37, "end_ms": 112370, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 108830, "text": "It's not going to be okay. How can you\npossibly say it is going to be okay?"}
{"cue": 38, "end_ms": 115090, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 113430, "text": "Because I'm pretty sure I'm in the\nclear."}
{"cue": 39, "end_ms": 144560, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 143560, "text": "Of course, I survived."}
{"cue": 40, "end_ms": 147460, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 146460, "text": "Checklist."}
{"cue": 41, "end_ms": 176460, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 175340, "text": "trouble deciding what to wear."}
{"cue": 42, "end_ms": 223800, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 221580, "text": "My name's Gus. Gus Melman."}
{"cue": 43, "end_ms": 227740, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 224200, "text": "Forgive me for not shaking hands. No,\nno, that's okay. That's okay."}
{"cue": 44, "end_ms": 233080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 229540, "text": "So, Gus, what brings you by?"}
{"cue": 45, "end_ms": 235340, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 233500, "text": "I'm committing suicide, and yourself?"}
{"cue": 46, "end_ms": 240660, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 238700, "text": "I'm not."}
{"cue": 47, "end_ms": 243260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 242260, "text": "Suit yourself."}
{"cue": 48, "end_ms": 248260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 244000, "text": "Well, if you'll excuse me, you know how\ncranky sharks get when you keep their"}
{"cue": 49, "end_ms": 249260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 248260, "text": "dinner waiting."}
{"cue": 50, "end_ms": 255310, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 254210, "text": "Don't do it."}
{"cue": 51, "end_ms": 260510, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 258089, "text": "You've done this before, haven't you?"}
{"cue": 52, "end_ms": 263710, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 262310, "text": "Well, I mean, why?"}
{"cue": 53, "end_ms": 265750, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 264130, "text": "Tell me why you're doing this."}
{"cue": 54, "end_ms": 268470, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 266090, "text": "Because I can't live with my failure\nanymore."}
{"cue": 55, "end_ms": 272370, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 269390, "text": "For the last 20 years, I've been an\ninventor."}
{"cue": 56, "end_ms": 274070, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 272730, "text": "You know the pet rock?"}
{"cue": 57, "end_ms": 276590, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 274350, "text": "Sure. That wasn't mine."}
{"cue": 58, "end_ms": 280150, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 278090, "text": "I never invented anything good."}
{"cue": 59, "end_ms": 284200, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 280800, "text": "Well, come on, Gus. After 20 years, you\nmust have had some good ideas."}
{"cue": 60, "end_ms": 288000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 285620, "text": "Well, there was the pocket aquarium."}
{"cue": 61, "end_ms": 292260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 291260, "text": "Ah."}
{"cue": 62, "end_ms": 294260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 292520, "text": "And then there was toe flops."}
{"cue": 63, "end_ms": 299180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 298160, "text": "Anything else?"}
{"cue": 64, "end_ms": 303480, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 300400, "text": "Well, my latest flop was the home root\ncanal kit."}
{"cue": 65, "end_ms": 309660, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 305880, "text": "Now, Gus, I can see how that would bring\nout the armchair dentist in all of us."}
{"cue": 66, "end_ms": 313220, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 311980, "text": "So what circus are you with?"}
{"cue": 67, "end_ms": 314680, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 313680, "text": "Huh?"}
{"cue": 68, "end_ms": 316300, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 315220, "text": "Oh, you mean the outfit."}
{"cue": 69, "end_ms": 318260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 316940, "text": "Pretty snazzy, huh?"}
{"cue": 70, "end_ms": 325660, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 320400, "text": "You know, Gus, I am about to pull off\nthe stunt of the century."}
{"cue": 71, "end_ms": 329800, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 325960, "text": "I'm going to glide over to the Statue of\nLiberty, and I'm going to play a prank"}
{"cue": 72, "end_ms": 335300, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 329800, "text": "so outrageous, so absolutely mind\n-boggling, that the entire world will be"}
{"cue": 73, "end_ms": 336860, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 335300, "text": "pondering it for generations."}
{"cue": 74, "end_ms": 339900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 337940, "text": "Sounds like a desperate plea for\nattention."}
{"cue": 75, "end_ms": 344880, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 343880, "text": "That, too."}
{"cue": 76, "end_ms": 349720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 346060, "text": "Okay, okay, okay. How about this plan?\nWe go underground. We live in the sewer"}
{"cue": 77, "end_ms": 352040, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 349720, "text": "system for five or six years just so\nthis thing blows over."}
{"cue": 78, "end_ms": 354560, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 353560, "text": "Can we?"}
{"cue": 79, "end_ms": 360200, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 356960, "text": "We're not going to live in the sewers.\nHey, come on. It only sounds bad. I"}
{"cue": 80, "end_ms": 362620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 360200, "text": "there's supposed to be a bunch of albino\nalligators down there. We could hunt"}
{"cue": 81, "end_ms": 363620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 362620, "text": "them for food."}
{"cue": 82, "end_ms": 365200, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 364200, "text": "No."}
{"cue": 83, "end_ms": 368020, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 366840, "text": "Oh, there you are."}
{"cue": 84, "end_ms": 370680, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 368280, "text": "Judge Crockett. Judge Stone is here. No,\nhe's not."}
{"cue": 85, "end_ms": 376460, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 372520, "text": "Let's get this bozo sworn in. Where is\nhe? He just pulled his jacket over his"}
{"cue": 86, "end_ms": 377500, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 376460, "text": "head and went into his chambers."}
{"cue": 87, "end_ms": 379580, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 377780, "text": "Once a loony, always a loony."}
{"cue": 88, "end_ms": 381140, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 380020, "text": "Let's get this over with."}
{"cue": 89, "end_ms": 383500, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 381400, "text": "Maybe I should straighten up a little\nfirst."}
{"cue": 90, "end_ms": 386080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 383780, "text": "You see, Judge Stone and I are sharing\nquarters."}
{"cue": 91, "end_ms": 389140, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 386740, "text": "I mean, we only share quarters here."}
{"cue": 92, "end_ms": 392540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 390060, "text": "I mean, we don't share quarters."}
{"cue": 93, "end_ms": 398180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 393160, "text": "I mean, I want to make it perfectly\nclear that we have never, ever had sex."}
{"cue": 94, "end_ms": 406110, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 401110, "text": "Together. I mean... She's okay. We just\nweaned her from the Bee Gees a bit too"}
{"cue": 95, "end_ms": 407110, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 406110, "text": "quickly."}
{"cue": 96, "end_ms": 409830, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 408470, "text": "I don't have time for this."}
{"cue": 97, "end_ms": 411610, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 410610, "text": "Open up, Stone!"}
{"cue": 98, "end_ms": 414370, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 413370, "text": "Just a minute!"}
{"cue": 99, "end_ms": 421530, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 417550, "text": "Well, yes, okay, Harry, we'll see you in\njust a little while. Fine, uh -huh. Oh!"}
{"cue": 100, "end_ms": 425350, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 422370, "text": "Hi, Judge Crockett. What a pleasant,\npleasant surprise."}
{"cue": 101, "end_ms": 426690, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 425690, "text": "Got that crap feeling."}
{"cue": 102, "end_ms": 428110, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 427110, "text": "Where's Stone going?"}
{"cue": 103, "end_ms": 430310, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 429310, "text": "He's thick."}
{"cue": 104, "end_ms": 433230, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 430670, "text": "And he's going to throw up in the\nbathroom."}
{"cue": 105, "end_ms": 436570, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 433750, "text": "What are you talking about? The\nbathroom's out this way. That's the way"}
{"cue": 106, "end_ms": 437570, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 436570, "text": "law library."}
{"cue": 107, "end_ms": 439330, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 438330, "text": "Err."}
{"cue": 108, "end_ms": 441430, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 439930, "text": "Well, let's hope he's quiet about it."}
{"cue": 109, "end_ms": 443269, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 442370, "text": "Judge Stone?"}
{"cue": 110, "end_ms": 446830, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 443270, "text": "He always likes to throw up between\ncontract law and civil dispute."}
{"cue": 111, "end_ms": 450390, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 449390, "text": "Where's Judge Crockett?"}
{"cue": 112, "end_ms": 451770, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 450770, "text": "Well, he left."}
{"cue": 113, "end_ms": 454050, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 452190, "text": "Because he had to find a telephone."}
{"cue": 114, "end_ms": 456970, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 455970, "text": "This one's broken."}
{"cue": 115, "end_ms": 462120, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 459500, "text": "Ringing like that without any warning at\nall."}
{"cue": 116, "end_ms": 465760, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 464300, "text": "Drives me batty."}
{"cue": 117, "end_ms": 471080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 468240, "text": "I would like to get started before dawn,\nJudge Stone."}
{"cue": 118, "end_ms": 477020, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 472740, "text": "Before we start, though, would you go\nfind my mom? She'd hate to miss this."}
{"cue": 119, "end_ms": 477919, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 477040, "text": "She's in the cafeteria."}
{"cue": 120, "end_ms": 478920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 477920, "text": "How will I know her?"}
{"cue": 121, "end_ms": 482080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 479560, "text": "Sequin Hot Pants, a big push -up bra.\nShe makes a great apple pie."}
{"cue": 122, "end_ms": 484540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 482400, "text": "You can't miss her. Thanks a lot, Judge.\nYou're a bait, really."}
{"cue": 123, "end_ms": 489510, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 487540, "text": "Well. So far, it's going great."}
{"cue": 124, "end_ms": 496130, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 492290, "text": "So that's when they told me they didn't\nneed my kind of judge on the bench."}
{"cue": 125, "end_ms": 502390, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 497030, "text": "My kind of judge. Boy, does that fly up\nyour nose with a bottle brush or what?"}
{"cue": 126, "end_ms": 507010, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 504710, "text": "Yeah, politics is a dirty business."}
{"cue": 127, "end_ms": 509330, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 507970, "text": "So what did you do about it?"}
{"cue": 128, "end_ms": 512429, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 509550, "text": "Well, I filed an appeal with the mayor's\ncommittee, but they rejected it."}
{"cue": 129, "end_ms": 514490, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 512929, "text": "Yeah? Then what?"}
{"cue": 130, "end_ms": 515929, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 514830, "text": "Then I, uh..."}
{"cue": 131, "end_ms": 518710, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 517710, "text": "I made this outfit."}
{"cue": 132, "end_ms": 522630, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 521630, "text": "That's it?"}
{"cue": 133, "end_ms": 525670, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 522929, "text": "You filed one little appeal and then you\njust quit?"}
{"cue": 134, "end_ms": 529470, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 526390, "text": "Hey, I didn't just quit, Gus. There was\nnothing else I could do."}
{"cue": 135, "end_ms": 533470, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 530310, "text": "Seems to me you always found a way when\nit was someone else on the line."}
{"cue": 136, "end_ms": 535470, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 534010, "text": "Why not do it for yourself?"}
{"cue": 137, "end_ms": 538950, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 535970, "text": "Yeah, well, you don't know anything\nabout it, Gus. You don't know what it's"}
{"cue": 138, "end_ms": 542270, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 538950, "text": "to lose your job and have everything you\never worked for taken away from you."}
{"cue": 139, "end_ms": 545310, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 542290, "text": "And why am I pouring my heart out to a\ndope on a..."}
{"cue": 140, "end_ms": 551400, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 549680, "text": "Maybe you're trying to convince\nyourself."}
{"cue": 141, "end_ms": 555980, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 552740, "text": "Gus, you ever hear the expression, you\ncan't fight City Hall?"}
{"cue": 142, "end_ms": 560580, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 556400, "text": "And did you ever hear the expression,\nwhen the going gets tough, the tough get"}
{"cue": 143, "end_ms": 563980, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 560580, "text": "up off their keisters and knuckle down\nbefore the journey of a thousand steps"}
{"cue": 144, "end_ms": 564980, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 563980, "text": "begins?"}
{"cue": 145, "end_ms": 582060, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 580620, "text": "Oh, wow, that's catchy."}
{"cue": 146, "end_ms": 586800, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 582260, "text": "That's what I'm telling you, Harry.\nDon't give up. Look who's talking. A guy"}
{"cue": 147, "end_ms": 589540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 586800, "text": "who's about to cast his face to the\nwind."}
{"cue": 148, "end_ms": 592660, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 589840, "text": "I fought the system for 20 years, Harry."}
{"cue": 149, "end_ms": 594620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 592980, "text": "How long did you fight?"}
{"cue": 150, "end_ms": 601640, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 600240, "text": "Come back in here, Dan."}
{"cue": 151, "end_ms": 603220, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 602220, "text": "No."}
{"cue": 152, "end_ms": 608640, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 605860, "text": "You can't stay out there forever, Dan."}
{"cue": 153, "end_ms": 609960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 608960, "text": "Why not?"}
{"cue": 154, "end_ms": 611370, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 610030, "text": "Got a great view of the park."}
{"cue": 155, "end_ms": 612950, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 611950, "text": "Plenty of air."}
{"cue": 156, "end_ms": 615070, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 613910, "text": "Fresh poultry."}
{"cue": 157, "end_ms": 619310, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 618310, "text": "Dan,"}
{"cue": 158, "end_ms": 622770, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 621410, "text": "are you going to make me do this the\nhard way?"}
{"cue": 159, "end_ms": 624450, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 623370, "text": "Yep. Good."}
{"cue": 160, "end_ms": 635530, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 629530, "text": "Just be glad it was your belt, Dan."}
{"cue": 161, "end_ms": 645070, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 640910, "text": "Your mother wasn't... Did I interrupt\nsomething?"}
{"cue": 162, "end_ms": 650090, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 645890, "text": "Oh, no, no, no. Oh, thank you very much,\nBill, if my spine feels much better"}
{"cue": 163, "end_ms": 651090, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 650090, "text": "now."}
{"cue": 164, "end_ms": 655170, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 653210, "text": "There's no one vomiting in the library."}
{"cue": 165, "end_ms": 657430, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 656430, "text": "Disappointed?"}
{"cue": 166, "end_ms": 662450, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 658950, "text": "Now that we're all here, could we please\nget started?"}
{"cue": 167, "end_ms": 665630, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 662670, "text": "What are you talking about? Judge Stone\nisn't here. What are you talking about,"}
{"cue": 168, "end_ms": 666730, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 665730, "text": "Judge..."}
{"cue": 169, "end_ms": 672820, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 671820, "text": "Leave that, Dan."}
{"cue": 170, "end_ms": 674720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 672940, "text": "Yeah, well, I'll puncture it myself if I\nhave to."}
{"cue": 171, "end_ms": 679480, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 676480, "text": "Uh, we better just tell them. Tell us\nwhat?"}
{"cue": 172, "end_ms": 681240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 680240, "text": "Okay, I'll tell you."}
{"cue": 173, "end_ms": 690320, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 683800, "text": "The truth is, we're all on a secret\nmission for the CIA."}
{"cue": 174, "end_ms": 693260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 692260, "text": "Right?"}
{"cue": 175, "end_ms": 699340, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 696360, "text": "Well, it's no secret that..."}
{"cue": 176, "end_ms": 702400, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 700620, "text": "Yes, I've always wanted to be a judge."}
{"cue": 177, "end_ms": 709400, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 704440, "text": "Even as a little boy, I would sentence\nmy pet turtle, Marcel, to"}
{"cue": 178, "end_ms": 716180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 709400, "text": "solitary confinement. I would nail his\nlittle cage shut."}
{"cue": 179, "end_ms": 718100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 716440, "text": "Just tell them. Hurry, fight!"}
{"cue": 180, "end_ms": 732080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 731080, "text": "You look great on my resume."}
{"cue": 181, "end_ms": 734220, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 732380, "text": "Hobbies? Killing members of the mayor's\ncommittee."}
{"cue": 182, "end_ms": 737160, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 735460, "text": "You didn't kill anybody, Dan."}
{"cue": 183, "end_ms": 739340, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 737440, "text": "No, I just turned him into a Brussels\nsprout."}
{"cue": 184, "end_ms": 743520, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 740800, "text": "The doctor said he'll be fine. He just\nneeds to rest."}
{"cue": 185, "end_ms": 749440, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 744660, "text": "See, Dan, by this time tomorrow, he'll\nbe up and around and ready to press"}
{"cue": 186, "end_ms": 750440, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 749440, "text": "charges."}
{"cue": 187, "end_ms": 756280, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 753460, "text": "Six, one thousand, seven, one thousand,\neight."}
{"cue": 188, "end_ms": 764820, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 759300, "text": "Bingo. Eight and a half. seconds okay\nstandard acceleration 32 feet per second"}
{"cue": 189, "end_ms": 771580, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 764820, "text": "per second 8 .5 divided by two we're\nabout 500 feet up wow"}
{"cue": 190, "end_ms": 778040, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 771580, "text": "you could tell all that from a glob of\nspit i never knew physics could be so"}
{"cue": 191, "end_ms": 782860, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 778040, "text": "useful einstein could sit in an airplane\nat 1600 feet and hop one right into a"}
{"cue": 192, "end_ms": 783860, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 782860, "text": "dixie cup"}
{"cue": 193, "end_ms": 791220, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 787859, "text": "You're no Einstein, Gus, but I gotta\ntell you, that glue you invented worked"}
{"cue": 194, "end_ms": 792220, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 791220, "text": "pretty good."}
{"cue": 195, "end_ms": 798240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 795260, "text": "It was supposed to be a feminine hygiene\nproduct."}
{"cue": 196, "end_ms": 806080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 801680, "text": "You're quite a guy, Gus. No, I mean it.\nYou've made me rethink my whole"}
{"cue": 197, "end_ms": 809080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 806080, "text": "situation. You know what it is I really\nwant?"}
{"cue": 198, "end_ms": 811860, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 810080, "text": "A condom that glows in the dark?"}
{"cue": 199, "end_ms": 827420, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 823400, "text": "want my job back. You know, if I'd spent\nas much time fighting for my job as I"}
{"cue": 200, "end_ms": 832420, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 827420, "text": "did on this crazy stunt, I'd be on the\nSupreme Court by now. And you made me"}
{"cue": 201, "end_ms": 833420, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 832420, "text": "realize that."}
{"cue": 202, "end_ms": 837940, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 833760, "text": "I did. Sure. I mean, look at you. You've\nbeen fighting the system for 20 years"}
{"cue": 203, "end_ms": 839880, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 837940, "text": "and you've got no discernible talent\nwhatsoever."}
{"cue": 204, "end_ms": 842620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 841620, "text": "Gee, thanks."}
{"cue": 205, "end_ms": 845660, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 844120, "text": "I'm going back there, Gus."}
{"cue": 206, "end_ms": 850000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 845860, "text": "I'm getting off my keister and I'm\nstarting the journey of a thousand"}
{"cue": 207, "end_ms": 852020, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 851020, "text": "Me too."}
{"cue": 208, "end_ms": 854790, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 853230, "text": "I love that there's a market out there\nfor me."}
{"cue": 209, "end_ms": 859950, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 855110, "text": "And now I know how to reach it. Good for\nyou, Gus. And I know you're going to"}
{"cue": 210, "end_ms": 863370, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 859950, "text": "make it because you got courage. You got\ndetermination."}
{"cue": 211, "end_ms": 865290, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 863990, "text": "You got my hand."}
{"cue": 212, "end_ms": 900149, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 899630, "text": "you, Mr."}
{"cue": 213, "end_ms": 901150, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 900150, "text": "Fenton."}
{"cue": 214, "end_ms": 906690, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 905130, "text": "Boy, he looks like he saw a ghost."}
{"cue": 215, "end_ms": 911410, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 908070, "text": "Okay, I've had it with all this\ninsanity. You people are stalling for"}
{"cue": 216, "end_ms": 914510, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 911410, "text": "reason. Now, I want to know right now,\nwhere the hell is Judge Stone?"}
{"cue": 217, "end_ms": 917570, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 916390, "text": "He's right here."}
{"cue": 218, "end_ms": 950540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 945000, "text": "to fight for his job, no matter how long\nit takes before I'm sworn back in. You"}
{"cue": 219, "end_ms": 951499, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 950540, "text": "got your job."}
{"cue": 220, "end_ms": 957540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 951500, "text": "Until these walls are smeared with the\nlast drops of my blood, I will fight! I"}
{"cue": 221, "end_ms": 958499, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 957540, "text": "will fight!"}
{"cue": 222, "end_ms": 961200, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 958500, "text": "I will... I... I beg your pardon?"}
{"cue": 223, "end_ms": 966880, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 962640, "text": "Can we get on with the swearing in,\nplease? I'd like to get home before my"}
{"cue": 224, "end_ms": 967880, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 966880, "text": "expires."}
{"cue": 225, "end_ms": 969280, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 968280, "text": "Here's your Bible."}
{"cue": 226, "end_ms": 973200, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 969380, "text": "Here's the judge. Is there something I\nshould know? Smile and keep your mouth"}
{"cue": 227, "end_ms": 974200, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 973200, "text": "shut, sir."}
{"cue": 228, "end_ms": 978330, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 977290, "text": "Raise your right hand."}
{"cue": 229, "end_ms": 981870, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 980470, "text": "Are you planning to shoot anyone?"}
{"cue": 230, "end_ms": 985230, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 983130, "text": "No. Fine, you're a judge again. Good\nnight."}
{"cue": 231, "end_ms": 1005840, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1004840, "text": "Mom and Dad."}
{"cue": 232, "end_ms": 1013020, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1009560, "text": "Sir, it sure is nice having you\nquarterbacking the team again."}
{"cue": 233, "end_ms": 1014600, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1013320, "text": "Well, it's good to be back, Matt."}
{"cue": 234, "end_ms": 1017320, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1014860, "text": "And that exploding gallop trick was a\npip, sir."}
{"cue": 235, "end_ms": 1020140, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1019140, "text": "Indeed."}
{"cue": 236, "end_ms": 1026579, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1022860, "text": "But don't you worry. These eyebrows will\ngrow back in two, three years' time."}
{"cue": 237, "end_ms": 1031040, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1029599, "text": "You're the Prince of Prank, Terry."}
{"cue": 238, "end_ms": 1032700, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1031460, "text": "Not anymore, he isn't."}
{"cue": 239, "end_ms": 1034280, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1033280, "text": "What do you mean?"}
{"cue": 240, "end_ms": 1040470, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1038990, "text": "to the Statue of Liberty."}
{"cue": 241, "end_ms": 1046030, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1043109, "text": "Gus Melman pulls off Stunt of the\nCentury."}
{"cue": 242, "end_ms": 1048730, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1047089, "text": "I don't believe it."}
{"cue": 243, "end_ms": 1052630, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1049210, "text": "Uh, sir, we're going to celebrate your\nhomecoming at the restaurant across the"}
{"cue": 244, "end_ms": 1055130, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1052630, "text": "street. You want to go rip up some\nchicken?"}
{"cue": 245, "end_ms": 1059090, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1056690, "text": "Oh, yeah, that sounds like fun. I'll be\nthere in a minute."}
{"cue": 246, "end_ms": 1060209, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1059330, "text": "Yes, sir."}
{"cue": 247, "end_ms": 1062310, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1060210, "text": "Great. Give me a chance to pencil in\nsome features."}
{"cue": 248, "end_ms": 1071130, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1069450, "text": "jump from the Brooklyn Bridge."}
{"cue": 249, "end_ms": 1073990, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1071990, "text": "Statue of Liberty."}
{"cue": 250, "end_ms": 1077150, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1075910, "text": "Glow in the dark."}
{"cue": 251, "end_ms": 1082130, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1080310, "text": "He's gonna be on Oprah?"}
{"cue": 252, "end_ms": 1088210, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1087210, "text": "Hi."}
{"cue": 253, "end_ms": 1089850, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1088850, "text": "Oh, hi there."}
{"cue": 254, "end_ms": 1091050, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1090050, "text": "Bad news?"}
{"cue": 255, "end_ms": 1092370, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1091230, "text": "Uh, no, no, no."}
{"cue": 256, "end_ms": 1096230, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1093490, "text": "Snoopy finally ate that bird that sits\non his stomach."}
{"cue": 257, "end_ms": 1100470, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1099470, "text": "How was your first day?"}
{"cue": 258, "end_ms": 1102950, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1101090, "text": "Well, you know, same old thing."}
{"cue": 259, "end_ms": 1106810, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1103650, "text": "Winos, drunk, freak, degenerate."}
{"cue": 260, "end_ms": 1109030, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1107790, "text": "God, it was beautiful."}
{"cue": 261, "end_ms": 1112910, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1110270, "text": "I never knew how much I liked being a\njudge until I was one."}
{"cue": 262, "end_ms": 1115010, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1113650, "text": "Yeah, I know what you mean."}
{"cue": 263, "end_ms": 1116410, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1115410, "text": "I'll bet you do."}
{"cue": 264, "end_ms": 1121390, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1118030, "text": "So, what do you say we shack up in a\ncheap motel and write Supreme Court"}
{"cue": 265, "end_ms": 1123090, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1121390, "text": "decisions all over each other's bodies?"}
{"cue": 266, "end_ms": 1125949, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1125070, "text": "Wait a minute."}
{"cue": 267, "end_ms": 1129150, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1125950, "text": "Oh, come on. You and me and a magic\nmarker built for two?"}
{"cue": 268, "end_ms": 1132410, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1130510, "text": "Well, that does sound educational."}
{"cue": 269, "end_ms": 1135850, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1133170, "text": "But we have to talk. About what?"}
{"cue": 270, "end_ms": 1141890, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1137650, "text": "We know we have some pretty strong\nfeelings for one another."}
{"cue": 271, "end_ms": 1143230, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1142230, "text": "Yeah."}
{"cue": 272, "end_ms": 1148050, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1144830, "text": "And at first the problem was that you\nwere a judge and I was a lawyer. Right."}
{"cue": 273, "end_ms": 1152130, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1148110, "text": "And then I was a judge and you were...\nAn unemployed lunatic."}
{"cue": 274, "end_ms": 1155490, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1153210, "text": "Right. But now we're both judges."}
{"cue": 275, "end_ms": 1158190, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1157190, "text": "No problem."}
{"cue": 276, "end_ms": 1161950, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1159550, "text": "Well, there is a wrinkle there."}
{"cue": 277, "end_ms": 1164870, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1163190, "text": "I'm no longer a judge."}
{"cue": 278, "end_ms": 1167410, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1166410, "text": "I quit."}
{"cue": 279, "end_ms": 1168790, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1167790, "text": "You quit?"}
{"cue": 280, "end_ms": 1170530, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1169530, "text": "Listen,"}
{"cue": 281, "end_ms": 1176110, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1170950, "text": "I... You quit? Please. I packed a\nsuitcase full of pink light bulbs and"}
{"cue": 282, "end_ms": 1177730, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1176110, "text": "Monroe records and..."}
{"cue": 283, "end_ms": 1183960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1182600, "text": "I put on that robe, I felt\nuncomfortable."}
{"cue": 284, "end_ms": 1185720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1184420, "text": "And then I felt nervous."}
{"cue": 285, "end_ms": 1187880, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1186580, "text": "And then I threw up."}
{"cue": 286, "end_ms": 1192900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1189840, "text": "I gather you're not just saying this to\nenhance the mood."}
{"cue": 287, "end_ms": 1197720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1194700, "text": "My body was telling me what my brain\nhadn't figured out yet."}
{"cue": 288, "end_ms": 1199440, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1197980, "text": "What was that? I'm not a judge."}
{"cue": 289, "end_ms": 1204760, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1199640, "text": "I'm an advocate. I like taking sides. A\njudge can't do that. Not if she wants to"}
{"cue": 290, "end_ms": 1205760, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1204760, "text": "be fair to her defendant."}
{"cue": 291, "end_ms": 1206739, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1205880, "text": "Oh, fine."}
{"cue": 292, "end_ms": 1207980, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1206740, "text": "Drag them into it."}
{"cue": 293, "end_ms": 1213330, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1209450, "text": "What I'm trying to say is that just as\nyou feel you were born to be a judge, I"}
{"cue": 294, "end_ms": 1215590, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1213330, "text": "feel I was born to be a defense\nattorney."}
{"cue": 295, "end_ms": 1220270, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1218050, "text": "I start back in your court tomorrow."}
{"cue": 296, "end_ms": 1228010, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1224250, "text": "Then I guess the magic marker is...\nBetter put a cap on it, sir."}
{"cue": 297, "end_ms": 1230930, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1229930, "text": "Yeah."}
{"cue": 298, "end_ms": 1233090, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1231590, "text": "Hate for it to dry out."}
{"cue": 299, "end_ms": 1239060, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1237990, "text": "Come here. Sorry."}
{"cue": 300, "end_ms": 1241139, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1240260, "text": "Don't be."}
{"cue": 301, "end_ms": 1243580, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1241140, "text": "You're just being true to yourself, and\nthat's important."}
{"cue": 302, "end_ms": 1246000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1244740, "text": "I'm happy for you."}
{"cue": 303, "end_ms": 1249200, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1248200, "text": "Thanks."}
{"cue": 304, "end_ms": 1254180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1252520, "text": "Well, tomorrow?"}
{"cue": 305, "end_ms": 1256760, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1255760, "text": "Sure."}
{"cue": 306, "end_ms": 1261220, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1260220, "text": "Miss Sullivan?"}
{"cue": 307, "end_ms": 1262460, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1261460, "text": "Yes?"}
{"cue": 308, "end_ms": 1263720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1262720, "text": "Thank you."}
{"cue": 309, "end_ms": 1265140, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1264140, "text": "For what?"}
{"cue": 310, "end_ms": 1266300, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1265260, "text": "Saving my job."}
{"cue": 311, "end_ms": 1269990, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1266700, "text": "Ah. My pleasure, Your Honor."}
{"cue": 312, "end_ms": 1276090, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1272330, "text": "Who knows? Maybe I'll get busted for\ngraft and I'll end up getting kicked off"}
{"cue": 313, "end_ms": 1277090, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1276090, "text": "the bench anyway, huh?"}
{"cue": 314, "end_ms": 1279350, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1278350, "text": "Keep a good thought."}
{"cue": 315, "end_ms": 1299320, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1298320, "text": "She loves me."}
{"cue": 316, "end_ms": 1302060, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1301020, "text": "She loves me."}
{"cue": 317, "end_ms": 1306420, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1303060, "text": "Thanks for the lift home, Mac. Hey, no\nproblem, no problem."}
{"cue": 318, "end_ms": 1307680, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1306680, "text": "Harry? Yeah?"}
{"cue": 319, "end_ms": 1309140, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1307880, "text": "Yeah, could I ask you something?"}
{"cue": 320, "end_ms": 1310600, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1309600, "text": "Sure."}
{"cue": 321, "end_ms": 1315120, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1311300, "text": "Why would you risk your life to hang\nglide to the Statue of Liberty? I mean,"}
{"cue": 322, "end_ms": 1318200, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1315160, "text": "with all due respect, that's about as\nstupid as a hit of cabbage."}
{"cue": 323, "end_ms": 1322340, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1318580, "text": "Well, I wasn't just gliding, Mac. I had\nsomething else in mind."}
{"cue": 324, "end_ms": 1328370, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1325270, "text": "It's kind of personal. If you don't\nmind, I don't want to talk about it."}
{"cue": 325, "end_ms": 1330430, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1329430, "text": "Oh."}
{"cue": 326, "end_ms": 1332450, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1330610, "text": "Well, I understand."}
{"cue": 327, "end_ms": 1336130, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1335130, "text": "Good night, Mac."}
{"cue": 328, "end_ms": 1338810, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1337810, "text": "Good night, Harry."}
{"cue": 329, "end_ms": 1343950, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1342950, "text": "Good night, Mac."}
{"cue": 330, "end_ms": 1347150, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1344750, "text": "Good night, Harry."}
{"cue": 331, "end_ms": 1361090, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1360090, "text": "Someday baby."}
{"cue": 332, "end_ms": 1363930, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1362930, "text": "Someday."}
